This directory is meant to contain announcement files. The main one should be called 'announce.main' (this default name can be changed in pyGEA.GEAVars module). If this file exists, is non-empty and pyGEA.GEAVars.showAnnouncement is set to true, the contents are displayed on every GEA page. 

The announce.cron is prepended to to announce.txt during every cron job executions to notify the user that the system is being heavily used.

